>## @requirement mapsToLowercaseOrUnchanged toLower returns the lowercase mapping of an uppercase code point, and returns a code point with no lowercase mapping (e.g. a digit, or an already-lowercase letter) unchanged.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
