>## @requirement usesSimpleNotFullMapping toLower uses the simple (one-to-one) Unicode case mapping, not full case folding: a code point whose full lowercase mapping would expand to multiple code points instead maps to its single-code-point simple mapping.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
