>## @requirement mapsToUppercaseOrUnchanged toUpper returns the uppercase mapping of a lowercase code point, and returns a code point with no uppercase mapping (e.g. a digit, or an already-uppercase letter) unchanged.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
